| 2 | \(1(c),2\): principalization modulo squares, followed by image descent | \(1/3\) **if both operations preserve contraction** | Efficient \(\theta\) with prescribed source-field valuation parity **and** a contracting certificate for \(\phi(\theta)\) | **SPECULATIVE**, open | 10% |
| 3 | \(4(a)\): retain partial rows and recombine globally | Potentially \(1/3\) | A rank/cycle theorem producing dependencies with nonzero projection onto the Dixon seed rows | **SPECULATIVE**, open | 10% |
